      "body": "### Project URL\n\nhttps://github.com/Blue-B/slopguard\n\n### Category\n\nJS\n\n### Project Title\n\nA GitHub App that scores AI-slop PRs/issues and quarantines them, human-in-the-loop\n\n### Project Description\n\nSlopGuard triages low-effort AI-generated PRs and issues. It scores each one 0-100, tags provenance, and adds a slop-quarantine label, never auto-closing. Maintainers decide with /slop commands. Free tier is heuristics-only, no API key, one-click install.\n\n### Highlights\n\nUnlike tools that auto-close (contributor-hostile) or only lint code, SlopGuard is GitHub-native triage with a human always making the final call. Heuristics-only mode hits 100% precision on the public eval set with zero config. Source-available, so beginners can read the whole detection pipeline and self-host it.\n\n### Example Code\n\n```markdown\n\n```\n\n### Screenshots or Demo Videos\n\n_No response_",
